# 0a_cliff_hall: GunTurret bases u047d/u0478, tops u0480/u0477. Scan both parts, force the base FSM states and the top's
# PowerDown/PowerUp, hurt and kill the top, then leave so the leash runs out (Withdraw).
# Run: BUILD=build-port-cov tools/cov/run.sh tools/cov/specs/gunturret.py <out> 1baa96c2,0a_cliff_hall --con <this> --fast --frames 3400
@f300 god 1; give missile 50
@f320 scan u0480 15 300
@f330 scan u047d 15 300
@f600 fsm u047d IntoPan
@f700 fsm u047d PanLeft
@f800 fsm u047d PanRight
@f900 fsm u047d AttackExit
@f1000 fsm u047d Flinch
@f1100 fsm u047d CloseDoor
@f1200 fsm u047d OpenDoor
@f1300 fsm u047d Withdraw
@f1400 fsm u0480 PowerDown
@f1500 fsm u0480 PowerUp
@f1550 fsm u047d Attack
@f1600 damage u0480 5
@f1700 damage u0480 5 missile
@f1800 fsm u0478 Patrol
@f1900 statecall u0478 IntoPan 0
@f1902 statecall u0478 IntoPan 1 0.016
@f1904 statecall u0478 IntoPan 2
@f1910 statecall u0478 AttackExit 0
@f1912 statecall u0478 AttackExit 1 0.016
@f1914 statecall u0478 AttackExit 2
@f1920 statecall u0478 Withdraw 0
@f1922 statecall u0478 Withdraw 1 0.016
@f1924 statecall u0478 Withdraw 2
@f2000 kill u0480
@f2200 obj u047d; obj u0480
@f2300 tp 31.9 -470 -154
@f2900 obj u047d; obj u0478
@f3000 kill u0477
@f3300 objs GunTurret
